        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "52b85398-ae01-3c0f-a72d-c39b016be43d",
                "word": "transparence",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c99c9ef9-9178-4a2e-8b67-fbccb2c254ca",
                        "entry_id": "52b85398-ae01-3c0f-a72d-c39b016be43d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "transparences"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f8990ae-4086-34fd-9f46-0c70f29ac291",
                        "entry_id": "52b85398-ae01-3c0f-a72d-c39b016be43d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caractère de ce qui est transparent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "657eb8f4-b053-4c1c-ba01-d25d3999feb0",
                                "sense_id": "0f8990ae-4086-34fd-9f46-0c70f29ac291",
                                "text": "Le crépuscule a partout la même transparence : on ne peut deviner de quel côté s’est couché le soleil, et l’armée française, qui sait si mal s’orienter, n’en a point ce soir le désavantage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7d37a25-2b6b-47e1-be60-20563e11f2e4",
                                "sense_id": "0f8990ae-4086-34fd-9f46-0c70f29ac291",
                                "text": "Leurs voiles légers ont la transparence bleuâtre des brumes matinales, et semblent, comme celles-ci, frémir dans la lumière qui les pénètre et qui s’y joue."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "654c1de5-ee78-4f34-9d4e-496ed99a8847",
                                "sense_id": "0f8990ae-4086-34fd-9f46-0c70f29ac291",
                                "text": "Ce qui me frappa surtout, c’est la transparence bleutée de l’air, l’extrême délicatesse de tons que prenait le ciel au-dessus des eaux du lagon, […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                        "entry_id": "52b85398-ae01-3c0f-a72d-c39b016be43d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caractère de ce qui ne cache rien, de ce qui ne dissimule rien…"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2478846c-5744-4ed2-958b-f2c6914f6e49",
                                "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                                "text": "La dénomination de nombreuses braderies et « foires à tout » joue la carte de la transparence : on sait qu'on trouvera, sortis des greniers, plus d'objets de peu de valeur et de nanars que de meubles de style et autres antiquités de prestige […].,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0228f31-7921-4814-a155-380ceab9fe69",
                                "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                                "text": "Un peu plus d'un an après l'entrée en vigueur des lois sur la transparence de la vie politique…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6dfaa3f-458f-4da3-8992-3c68ef99116d",
                                "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                                "text": "La fondation américaine conseille aux cadres des associations qu’elle finance d’éviter de se porter candidat et, s’ils le font, de faire preuve du maximum de transparence possible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c0de35d-6d73-48b1-ae37-fc02c38bc5c9",
                                "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                                "text": "LA qualité cardinale. Faire preuve de transparence : n'avoir rien à cacher, être pur. … Le contraire de la transparence est le sale, le suspect, le louche. L'exigence impitoyable de transparence a par ailleurs donné naissance à toute une génération de censeurs et aussi à l'autocensure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a000eea2-0b1b-487d-b2ec-fdfaadb2d1bf",
                                "sense_id": "f43c407d-5f09-33d7-8860-f40ad7dc7b19",
                                "text": "\"Nos conclusions révèlent une négligence grave de la part des partis politiques et des plateformes qui ne respectent pas leurs engagements en matière d'étiquetage des images générées par l'IA dans le cadre de leurs campagnes politiques, soulignant ainsi le besoin urgent de transparence\", peut-on lire dans le rapport."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f77341b8-6429-4be0-b453-22544ef56b4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "52b85398-ae01-3c0f-a72d-c39b016be43d",
                        "target_lang_word": "transparency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transparency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6db57233-1d85-3647-907d-9ebe5451a155",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being transparent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0ee219e-d1db-38cb-b88c-3dd5fd8c81e9",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Openness; accessibility to scrutiny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d809624a-8c4e-44f3-a4f3-2bf33d2f7b74",
                                                "sense_id": "e0ee219e-d1db-38cb-b88c-3dd5fd8c81e9",
                                                "text": "And it [bribery and fraud] didn't stop there. Both Sir Winston Churchill and later Labour leader Michael Foot were allegedly regular recipients of private cheques that would have seen them summarily sacked in this present age of transparency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0604e6bd-f99b-34fb-82d7-36babb0bfd9d",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A transparent artwork, viewable by shining light through it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc1af6d8-43d9-407c-88aa-a514bf54fdc0",
                                                "sense_id": "0604e6bd-f99b-34fb-82d7-36babb0bfd9d",
                                                "text": "According to Bray (Life of Stothard, p. 50), the silversmiths Rundell and Bridge displayed a large transparency by Thomas Stothard, painted in thin oils on canvas and lit from behind, in front of their house on Ludgate Hill in honour of the King's Jubilee in 1810."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67190726-6cdd-4db2-a41c-9a1193ce4add",
                                                "sense_id": "0604e6bd-f99b-34fb-82d7-36babb0bfd9d",
                                                "text": "It soon came: as they were on their way to a transparency of their majesties, not a little larger than life—with Bellona, in a very handsome helmet, on one side, and Peace, with a cornucopia and a full blown wreath of roses, on the other—the path was interrupted by a little knot of gentlemen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b81a0f2-85ea-396c-89ce-23b1815b6b02",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A translucent film-like material with an image imprinted on it, viewable by shining light through it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07464f16-3c20-3937-9eab-113a56eb3bf5",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something transparent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87fd4dac-3335-4634-b36a-b7e9a531e469",
                                                "sense_id": "07464f16-3c20-3937-9eab-113a56eb3bf5",
                                                "text": "John Lehmann's narrator Jack Marlowe is such a transparency, and his fiction is totally formless."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54d923a8-ab5a-33dd-aaaa-cf2c4e6edc9e",
                                        "entry_id": "fbb3792b-3a97-3d7c-82a7-e90e92c80432",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sufficient accuracy to make the compressed result perceptually indistinguishable from the uncompressed input."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
